{"id":"green-puni","name":{"en":"Green Puni","ja":"緑ぷに"},"desc":{"en":"This Puni is a bit tougher than its Blue Puni brethren. It's still plush. No matter how strong, a Puni is still a Puni.","ja":"緑色のぷにぷに。青ぷによりはやや硬いが、それでも触感はぷにぷにしている。やや強いといっても所詮ぷにぷにレベルなので、そこまで警戒しなくても大丈夫。"},"race":"Puni","hp":40,"atk":14,"defen":4,"spd":6,"level":4,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-west-ruins","name":{"en":"Alanya West Ruins","ja":"アランヤ西部遺跡地帯"}},{"id":"alanya-area","name":{"en":"Alanya Area","ja":"アランヤ周辺地域"}},{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}},{"id":"southwest-peninsula","name":{"en":"Southwest Peninsula","ja":"大陸南西半島"}},{"id":"stein-hill","name":{"en":"Stein Hill","ja":"シュタイン丘陵"},"parent":"alanya-west-ruins"}],"item_set":[{"id":"puniball","name":{"en":"Puniball","ja":"ぷにぷに玉"}}],"isDX":false,"index":3}